{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103370","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103370","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710337001:1":{"text":"秘银工号1095，很高兴为您服务，您有什么需要的吗？","source_cn":"秘银工号1095，很高兴为您服务，您有什么需要的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754E48F64172A853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710337002:1":{"text":"我……我要投诉。我要投诉你们的商品包装与实际产品不符。","source_cn":"我……我要投诉。我要投诉你们的商品包装与实际产品不符。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE057389EFCED5D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710337003:1":{"text":"请问是哪款产品出现了您所说的问题呢？有实物可以看下吗？","source_cn":"请问是哪款产品出现了您所说的问题呢？有实物可以看下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9800C5539AC5522A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710337004:1":{"text":"我们买的这款玩偶，包装上明明是只狐狸，为什么打开以后变成了龙玩偶？我要投诉！","source_cn":"我们买的这款玩偶，包装上明明是只狐狸，为什么打开以后变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA6CCFD38A248A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710337005:1":{"text":"哦哦，您请看，包装上有行小字写着，“图片仅供参考，产品请以实物为准”，","source_cn":"哦哦，您请看，包装上有行小字写着，“图片仅供参考，产品...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x934609E85893E6F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":